          "widget": {
            "name": "adopt_title",
            "multilineTextboxSpec": {
              "lines": [
                "# Adoption\n",
                "\n",
                "Which parts of the Databricks platform this workspace actually uses. Each of 51 checks scores **ACTIVE** (in real use), **MINIMAL** (present, barely used) or **NONE** (no evidence).\n",
                "\n",
                "This is breadth, not quality. A workspace can use a capability heavily and use it badly \u2014 that is a different question, and a different page.\n"
              ]
            }
          },
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 0,
            "width": 6,
            "height": 5
          }
        },
